{
  "name": "@godcreator/explainer",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "讲解组件：分步、动画、选情况三种外壳配一句一句的说明，用固定的控制条播放和切换；接缝图把一个系统分成模块、按接缝逐条讲。`.` 是机读文字规则（各步说明、接缝图写成给 AI 读的文字，供站点的组件名册用，不 import react）与接缝图的定义；`./site` 是组件：分步、动画、选情况三种外壳，面板、终端、胶囊、代码行等画帧用的零件，画系统接缝图的 SeamDiagram，共用一套样式 `./styles.css`。template/ 是建站器复制进站点 app/features/explainer/ 的样式接线。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "sideEffects": [
    "*.css"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./dist/core/index.d.mts",
      "default": "./dist/core/index.mjs"
    },
    "./site": {
      "types": "./dist/site/index.d.mts",
      "default": "./dist/site/index.mjs"
    },
    "./styles.css": "./styles/explain.css"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "styles",
    "template",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/godcreator02/god-docsite.git",
    "directory": "packages/explainer"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "registry": "https://registry.npmjs.org/",
    "access": "public"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsdown",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "check": "pnpm typecheck && pnpm test && pnpm lint",
    "lint": "oxlint . --deny-warnings"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "react": "^19.3.0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "react": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "catalog:",
    "@types/react": "catalog:",
    "@types/react-dom": "catalog:",
    "react": "catalog:",
    "react-dom": "catalog:",
    "tsdown": "catalog:",
    "typescript": "catalog:",
    "vitest": "catalog:"
  }
}
